{
  "chapter": "A16",
  "title": "Across properties",
  "manualShots": "a16",
  "videos": [
    {
      "id": "A16-01",
      "slug": "A16-01-all-properties-the-group-today",
      "section": "A16.2",
      "title": "All properties: the group today",
      "intro": {
        "text": "Across properties holds three screens that sit above any one hotel: All properties, Properties and People. This first video is All properties, for the owner and Admin.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/01.wav",
        "dur": 10.647
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Open All properties, under Across properties in the menu. Each property is shown on its own business date.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/02.wav",
            "dur": 6.514
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "The dark panel is the group today: occupancy, average rate, RevPAR and room revenue, every property added up.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/03.wav",
            "dur": 8.017
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Under each figure, the month so far, and the same month last year.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/04.wav",
            "dur": 4.36
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Last year counts only the properties that sold a room in that month a year back. Here it reads 0 of 1, so the last year figures are a dash.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/05.wav",
            "dur": 8.499
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Needs you lists what to act on, at every property. A property whose business date is behind comes first.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/06.wav",
            "dur": 6.862
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-01",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Each line names the property and what is waiting, such as an arrival not yet checked in. Click it to open the screen that deals with it.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/07.wav",
            "dur": 7.454
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-02",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Below, there is a row for each property, with its business date. Click its name to open its Rooms.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/08.wav",
            "dur": 5.736
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-02",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Each figure shows today on top, and the month so far under it.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/09.wav",
            "dur": 3.954
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-02",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The last column compares this month's room revenue so far with the same month last year.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/10.wav",
            "dur": 5.184
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-02",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "A property with nothing to compare says No last year yet.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/11.wav",
            "dur": 3.373
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "A figure that did not come back is a dash, never a zero. And test hotels are never counted here.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-01/12.wav",
        "dur": 6.386
      },
      "next": "Properties: a card per property"
    },
    {
      "id": "A16-02",
      "slug": "A16-02-properties-a-card-per-property",
      "section": "A16.3",
      "title": "Properties: a card per property",
      "intro": {
        "text": "Properties shows a card for each hotel. The owner sees more on it than everyone else. Here are both.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/01.wav",
        "dur": 6.3
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "This is the owner's view. The line under the title counts the properties open, and any closed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/02.wav",
            "dur": 5.771
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Each card shows the property's name and its code.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/03.wav",
            "dur": 3.083
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Then its rooms, its room types, and its G S T I N, which prints on every invoice. Under it, the G S T in use for rooms, the restaurant and the rest.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/04.wav",
            "dur": 10.415
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Open shows the property's own page, with its figures and its team.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/05.wav",
            "dur": 4.348
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Calendar switches to the property, and opens its Rooms screen.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/06.wav",
            "dur": 4.023
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "Edit changes its details. The next video shows how.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/07.wav",
            "dur": 4.029
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 7,
          "line": {
            "text": "Close takes a property out of every picker. Nothing is deleted, and Reopen brings it back. Close does not ask first.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/08.wav",
            "dur": 7.46
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-03",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "While guests are checked in, Close is off, and the card says why.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/09.wav",
            "dur": 4.081
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-06",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Everyone else sees a simpler card. Here, the general manager's.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/10.wav",
            "dur": 4.413
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-06",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Only the properties you can reach are listed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/11.wav",
            "dur": 2.723
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-06",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Each shows the check in and check out times.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/12.wav",
            "dur": 2.827
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-06",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "And the G S T in use, one line for each kind.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/13.wav",
            "dur": 3.199
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-06",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Open the Calendar takes you into that property, on its Rooms screen.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/14.wav",
            "dur": 4.035
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "Under each card, the owner can also make a test hotel: a practice copy of that hotel's setup, with no guests or money.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-02/15.wav",
        "dur": 7.704
      },
      "next": "Editing and adding a property"
    },
    {
      "id": "A16-03",
      "slug": "A16-03-editing-and-adding-a-property",
      "section": "A16.4",
      "title": "Editing and adding a property",
      "intro": {
        "text": "This video is for the owner: changing a property's details, and adding a new property.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/01.wav",
        "dur": 5.196
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "On the property's card, click Edit. These details print on the property's invoices.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/02.wav",
            "dur": 5.469
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "The code is shown, greyed out.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/03.wav",
            "dur": 2.259
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "It is in every web address and every invoice number, so it cannot be changed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/04.wav",
            "dur": 4.894
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Change the name, city, state, address, phone or email as needed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/05.wav",
            "dur": 4.453
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The G S T I N is fifteen characters, the two-digit state code first.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/06.wav",
            "dur": 4.917
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-04",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Save. If something is wrong, the message says why, and nothing is saved.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/07.wav",
            "dur": 5.504
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-05",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "To add a property, scroll down to Add a property.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/08.wav",
            "dur": 3.454
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-05",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type its code, two to eight letters or digits. Choose it with care: it can never be changed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/09.wav",
            "dur": 5.864
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-05",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Then its name and its city, and if you have them, its state and G S T I N.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/10.wav",
            "dur": 4.836
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-05",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type the provisioning key, the key for this system. Being signed in is not enough on its own.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/11.wav",
            "dur": 5.539
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-05",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Create the property. The new property has its room types, but no rooms yet. Add its rooms next.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/12.wav",
            "dur": 6.95
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "The rest of a property's profile, such as its PIN code and website, is kept in Settings.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-03/13.wav",
        "dur": 5.985
      },
      "next": "One property and its team"
    },
    {
      "id": "A16-04",
      "slug": "A16-04-one-property-and-its-team",
      "section": "A16.5",
      "title": "One property and its team",
      "intro": {
        "text": "Each property has its own page, with its figures and the people who work there. The owner opens it with Open, on the property's card.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/01.wav",
        "dur": 7.361
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "The first row is today: rooms sold, occupancy, rooms empty, and guests in house now.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/02.wav",
            "dur": 6.009
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The second is the month to date: room revenue, average rate, RevPAR, and the rooms the property has. A figure not measured yet is a dash.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/03.wav",
            "dur": 8.952
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "The F S S A I licence number prints on food bills. The owner, an Admin or the GM clicks Change to type it.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/04.wav",
            "dur": 7.408
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Who works here lists everyone at this property, with their role.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/05.wav",
            "dur": 3.652
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "Starts on is the first screen after they sign in: Dashboard, Rooms or Calendar. It saves as soon as you choose.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/06.wav",
            "dur": 7.28
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 7,
          "line": {
            "text": "The key sets a new password for them.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/07.wav",
            "dur": 2.363
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 8,
          "line": {
            "text": "Remove takes them off this property. It asks first, and their account stays.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/08.wav",
            "dur": 5.028
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-07",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "To add somebody, click Add somebody here.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/09.wav",
            "dur": 2.92
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-08",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type their name.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/10.wav",
            "dur": 1.167
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-08",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "And the email they sign in with. A typo here means they cannot sign in at all.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/11.wav",
            "dur": 5.248
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-08",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type a password for them, at least eight characters. It shows as you type, so you can read it back.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/12.wav",
            "dur": 6.537
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-08",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Choose what they do here.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/13.wav",
            "dur": 1.724
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-08",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Add. They can sign in straight away, and see this property only. Tell them the password yourself: nothing is emailed.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/14.wav",
            "dur": 7.6
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "A GM or Admin can open their own property's page too. Anybody else is told it is not theirs to manage.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-04/15.wav",
        "dur": 6.874
      },
      "next": "People: everyone, and where they work"
    },
    {
      "id": "A16-05",
      "slug": "A16-05-people-everyone-and-where-they-work",
      "section": "A16.6",
      "title": "People: everyone, and where they work",
      "intro": {
        "text": "People lists everybody who can sign in: where they work, and as what. In this video you will read the list, take a property away, and switch somebody off.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/01.wav",
        "dur": 9.231
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-10",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Open People. The line under the title counts the people active, and how many reach every property.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/02.wav",
            "dur": 5.852
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-10",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "A yellow note names anybody who can sign in and see nothing. Give them a property, or the system looks broken to them.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/03.wav",
            "dur": 7.118
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Every property marks a group administrator. They reach every property, including ones added later.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/04.wav",
            "dur": 6.224
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Everyone else has a chip for each property they work at, with their role there.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/05.wav",
            "dur": 4.197
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "No property yet means this account opens empty.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/06.wav",
            "dur": 3.118
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Give a property fixes that. The next video shows how.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/07.wav",
            "dur": 3.774
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The cross on a chip takes that property away.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/08.wav",
            "dur": 2.932
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-13",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "It asks first, naming who and where.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/09.wav",
            "dur": 2.897
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-13",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "They can no longer work there. Their account stays, and their name stays on everything they did.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/10.wav",
            "dur": 5.562
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-13",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Remove, or Cancel.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/11.wav",
            "dur": 1.933
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-09",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "Deactivate switches somebody off: they can no longer sign in. It does not ask first. Bring them back undoes it.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/12.wav",
            "dur": 7.739
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "Nobody is ever deleted. Somebody who has left is switched off, so their name stays on everything they did.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-05/13.wav",
        "dur": 6.735
      },
      "next": "Adding somebody, and giving them a property"
    },
    {
      "id": "A16-06",
      "slug": "A16-06-adding-somebody-and-giving-them-a-property",
      "section": "A16.7",
      "title": "Adding somebody, and giving them a property",
      "intro": {
        "text": "Access is given property by property. That is what stops one hotel seeing another's guests. Here is how to add somebody, as the owner and as the GM.",
        "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/01.wav",
        "dur": 9.655
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A16-10",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "On People, click Add somebody.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/02.wav",
            "dur": 2.398
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type their name.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/03.wav",
            "dur": 1.132
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "And the email they will sign in with. A typo here means they cannot sign in at all.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/04.wav",
            "dur": 5.423
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Type a password for them, at least eight characters.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/05.wav",
            "dur": 3.315
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "It is hidden. Show lets you read it back to them.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/06.wav",
            "dur": 3.135
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "This adds an ordinary member of staff. Making somebody a group administrator, who reaches every property, takes the provisioning key.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/07.wav",
            "dur": 7.849
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-11",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Add. They can sign in now, but see nothing until they have a property.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/08.wav",
            "dur": 4.529
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-12",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "So on their card, click Give a property, and choose which property.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/09.wav",
            "dur": 4.174
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-12",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Choose what they do there.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/10.wav",
            "dur": 1.829
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-12",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The line underneath says what that role does.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/11.wav",
            "dur": 2.735
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-12",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Click Give access.",
            "voice": "a16/voice/A16-06/12.wav",
            "dur": 1.399
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A16-16",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "A GM adds somebody at their own property, in one step. Where they work offers their own hotel.",
